---
// TwoDegrees 랜딩 히어로: frontend/app/page.tsx
---
<div class="m">
  <span class="pill"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>지인 기반 프라이빗 매칭</span>
  <p class="title">세상 모든 인연은 6단계면 닿지만, 우리는 딱 <u>2단계</u>까지만 믿기로 했습니다.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <span class="primary">지금 바로 등록하기</span>
    <span class="pair">
      <span class="outline">이미 등록하셨나요?</span>
      <span class="kakao">서비스 문의하기</span>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .m {
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 24px 18px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #eff6ff, #ffffff 60%);
    color: #0f172a;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #475569;
  }
  .pill i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2563eb; }
  .title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }
  .title u { color: #2563eb; text-decoration-color: #bfdbfe; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .actions { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: auto; }
  .primary {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 13px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .pair { display: flex; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
  .pair span { flex: 1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 4px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .outline { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #475569; background: #ffffff; }
  .kakao { background: #fee500; color: #191919; }
</style>
